      401.88,
      394.91
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 36 of the Finance Act, No. 35 of 2018 is herebyamended in subsection (1) thereof, by the substitution for thewords and figures \u201cending on December 31, 2021,\u201d of thewords and figures \u201cending on December 31, 2019,\u201d.",
